<title>UK: Syria buys cargo white sugar at $368.95/T - trade.</title>
<headline>Syria buys cargo white sugar at $368.95/T - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syira bought one cargo of white sugar for October 20/November 20 shipment, London sugar traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The price was $368.95 per tonne, they said, adding that the name of the supplier was not yet known. Syria originally tendered to buy 13,000 tonnes of whites and 13,000 tonnes of raws. Details of the result of the raws tender have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
